    { "cardId": "c1-offentlichkeit", "fieldPath": "study.explanation", "before": "Main idea: die Öffentlichkeit means society as public space or people as a whole. In the phrase an die Öffentlichkeit kommen, it means to come into the open.", "after": "Main idea: die Öffentlichkeit refers to the public sphere or the public at large. In the phrase an die Öffentlichkeit kommen, it means to become public." },
